@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #000000
skinparam ComponentFontColor #000000
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #000000
skinparam RectangleFontColor #000000

title Linear Issue Flow Before Template Enforcement

actor "LLM / Agent" as Agent #E8F0FE
rectangle "Ad-hoc Integration Script\n(or direct API calls)" as Script #FFF4CC
component "Linear GraphQL API" as LinearApi #FFE5E5
database "Linear Workspace" as LinearData #EAF7EA
note right of Script #FFFDEB
No central template contract.
Issue descriptions vary by caller.
Validation is manual and inconsistent.
end note

Agent --> Script : Unstructured issue request
Script --> LinearApi : createIssue / updateIssue
LinearApi --> LinearData : Persist issue payload

@enduml

